       "15:00 UTC Thu W14: Consumer team readiness sign-off"
       "09:00 UTC Fri W14: Final gate decision + phase gates locked"]

      :gate-blockers ["M5 W13 gate PASS"]
      :gate-pass-action "Unlock M6 Week 15-16 parallel consumer migration"
      :gate-fail-action "Remediate gaps; retry gate W14 Fri or W15 Mon (consumer teams must resolve within 48h)"
